WEBVTT

00:02:57.356 --> 00:03:01.938
These three spots must contain 
the extreme values—

00:03:01.938 --> 00:03:04.218
the best and worst probabilities—

00:03:04.218 --> 00:03:05.826
for the entire line.

00:03:05.826 --> 00:03:09.928
In other words,
they’re all we need to consider.

00:03:09.928 --> 00:03:11.248
Place 1 is bad.

00:03:11.248 --> 00:03:14.718
Head one would save you, and the other
two doom you forever.

00:03:14.718 --> 00:03:17.508
That’s just a 1 in 3 chance to escape.

00:03:17.508 --> 00:03:21.058
Place 2 is better: head two is great,

00:03:21.058 --> 00:03:26.652
head 3 is bad, and head 1 is ok
in that it gives you another chance.

00:03:26.652 --> 00:03:31.324
But place 3 is best, 
because head 3 saves you